{"w":2400,"h":3390,"lines":[{"y":0.0058139535281626076,"c":1,"t":"@MirsIELTS","h":0.034883720825555353,"x":0.0082135492060518081,"w":0.30390144348144527},{"h":0.015164847359896427,"y":0.044743157566278113,"c":1,"w":0.061892560323079437,"t":"Test 4","x":0.84585043478411304},{"h":0.015460335610538833,"x":0.073855758498261814,"t":"species, is the sign of a highly successful tree-planting scheme. To ensure the survival and","c":1,"y":0.090870496096830289,"w":0.71471801757812492},{"t":"resilience of a planted forest, it's vital to use tree seeds with appropriate levels of genetic","x":0.073921974340356897,"h":0.013090828527039911,"y":0.10755813927073188,"w":0.70020533243815108,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.071868580344089522,"y":0.12354651183514864,"t":"diversity: the amount of genetic variation found within a species essential for their survival.","w":0.71457906087239587,"h":0.014534883302221635},{"x":0.071868574320297543,"t":"Using seeds with low genetic diversity generally lowers the resilience of restored forests,","h":0.01456318126667222,"c":1,"y":0.13805309757409923,"w":0.70431213378906254},{"y":0.15311308019309611,"x":0.071823093540528141,"w":0.66539932250976552,"t":"which can make them vulnerable to disease and unable to adapt to climate change.","h":0.015528353125648153,"c":1},{"h":0.014574329409979159,"w":0.70431213378906254,"t":"Choosing the right location for reforestation projects is as important as choosing the right","x":0.071868573637516225,"y":0.17728613549435013,"c":1},{"x":0.06981519919483313,"y":0.1932153392701611,"w":0.73305953979492189,"h":0.014749262536873142,"t":"trees. Ultimately, the best area for planting trees would be in formerly forested areas that are","c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.70841888427734379,"h":0.013116553540075127,"t":"in poor condition. It's better to avoid non-torested landscapes such as natural grasslands,","y":0.2093023253177787,"x":0.071868586505186058},{"w":0.71457906087239587,"x":0.073921968617458061,"y":0.22383720903494519,"t":"savannas or wetlands as these ecosystems already contribute greatly to capturing carbon.","h":0.013081395872222901,"c":1},{"w":0.72073918660481773,"h":0.016012381944684462,"c":1,"y":0.23834808285397813,"x":0.071868605183217277,"t":"It would also be advantageous to choose an area where trees could provide other benefits,"},{"c":1,"y":0.25427728635541036,"x":0.071868574193622969,"t":"such as recreational spaces. Reforesting areas which are currently exploited for agriculture","w":0.72073923746744795,"h":0.014749262536873031},{"c":1,"t":"should be avoided as this often leads to other areas being deforested.","x":0.071868594416910792,"y":0.27020648956736182,"w":0.5564681498209636,"h":0.014749262536873142},{"t":"Q33","x":0.83778234041623367,"y":0.14098837235763284,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"w":0.039014374415079711},{"y":0.25581395372391191,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"t":"Q34","x":0.83778234048239864,"w":0.039014374415079711},{"y":0.31533923287927357,"h":0.014749262536873142,"t":"Large-scale reforestation projects require careful planning. Making the right decisions about","c":1,"w":0.72689936319986981,"x":0.071868593451108895},{"w":0.73731465657552087,"h":0.02014577634918302,"c":1,"y":0.32581185979760385,"t":"where to plant trees depends on having the right information. Having detailed and up-to-date","x":0.071809242711244017},{"h":0.017158548248200955,"x":0.071828546903404719,"t":"maps identifying high-priority areas for intervention is essential. Drone technology is a useful","w":0.7331295267740886,"y":0.34353299124590519,"c":1},{"t":"tool in helping to prioritise and monitor areas of degraded forest for restoration. In Brazil, it's","w":0.72484598795572919,"x":0.071868587206923656,"y":0.3604651163903323,"h":0.015988371857499573,"c":1},{"x":0.071868574430068194,"y":0.37640117996485034,"h":0.014587191916496711,"t":"being used to identify and quantify how parts of the Amazon are being devastated by human","w":0.72895278930664065,"c":1},{"y":0.39115857934468834,"t":"activities such as rearing cattle and illegal logging.","c":1,"h":0.015864551735486954,"x":0.07179216190624596,"w":0.40059463500976555},{"t":"A good example of where the right trees were picked to achieve a restored forest is in","x":0.073921967127654212,"w":0.67351130167643225,"h":0.01179941002949858,"c":1,"y":0.41563421805175638},{"c":1,"h":0.014749262536873142,"x":0.071868593714241716,"y":0.43008849556906237,"t":"Lampang Province in Northern Thailand. A previously forested site which had been degraded","w":0.73511291503906251},{"t":"through mining was reforested by a cement company together with Chiang Mai University.","w":0.71252568562825525,"x":0.071868573926233623,"c":1,"y":0.44622093043959055,"h":0.014546031445528573},{"x":0.071868574443478883,"h":0.014534883302221635,"y":0.46220930253288273,"t":"After spreading 60 cm of topsoil, they planted 14 different native tree species which included","w":0.72895278930664054,"c":1},{"t":"several species of fig. Figs are a keystone species because of the critical role they play in","w":0.7084188842773439,"x":0.071868586529408793,"y":0.47669616495355482,"c":1,"h":0.014582904601870617},{"t":"maintaining wildlife populations. They are central to tropical reforestation projects as they","y":0.49262536872895857,"w":0.70431213378906243,"x":0.071868573675339137,"h":0.014749262536873253,"c":1},{"t":"accelerate the speed of the recovery process by attracting animals and birds which act as","h":0.011633052094496055,"x":0.073921968191559606,"y":0.5087209300599409,"w":0.70636550903320316,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.52325581398115673,"h":0.014534883302221524,"x":0.07186858845054403,"w":0.70636550903320305,"t":"natural seed dispersers. This helps to promote diversity through the healthy regrowth of a"},{"w":0.70841888427734379,"h":0.015999519438166909,"t":"wide range of plant species. Unlike the majority of fruit trees, figs bear fruit all year round,","x":0.071868586521914329,"c":1,"y":0.53923303858086846},{"t":"providing a reliable food source for many species. At this site, for example, after only three","x":0.073921962013302506,"y":0.55516224197740838,"w":0.71252568562825525,"h":0.013274336283185861,"c":1},{"y":0.5697674420455946,"w":0.67556467692057298,"t":"rainy seasons, monkeys started visiting to eat the fig fruits, naturally dispersing seeds","h":0.014598339497163937,"c":1,"x":0.071868586245394633},{"h":0.013081395872222901,"y":0.5857558136810731,"w":0.15605749766031901,"c":1,"t":"through defecation.","x":0.073921969731122347},{"x":0.073921981542041423,"w":0.72689936319986981,"h":0.011637339971761862,"c":1,"y":0.60901162773522,"t":"Reforestation projects should always aim to make sure that local communities are consulted"},{"h":0.016724181948861494,"t":"and involved in the decision-making process.","x":0.073768779084227507,"c":1,"w":0.35766680399576817,"y":0.62222445155147532},{"w":0.69815195719401046,"c":1,"h":0.014554606637420253,"x":0.073921972583692749,"y":0.64680232560906359,"t":"The restoration of mangrove forests in Madagascar is an example of a project which has"},{"h":0.014534883302221635,"x":0.071868586774839399,"t":"succeeded in creating real benefits for the community. Destruction of the mangrove forests","y":0.66279069788119571,"w":0.71663243611653649,"c":1},{"t":"had a terrible impact on plant and animal life, and also badly affected the fishing industry,","y":0.67737798390511872,"w":0.70441650390624999,"x":0.07181928019661328,"h":0.015975239846558686,"c":1},{"h":0.014749262536873142,"c":1,"t":"which was a major source of employment for local people living in coastal areas. The","w":0.67351130167643225,"x":0.071868579038908587,"y":0.69469026534047273},{"y":0.70930232578706054,"h":0.014591479793762407,"t":"reforestation project involved hiring local people to plant and care for the new mangrove","c":1,"x":0.071868573361257931,"w":0.69609858194986984},{"y":0.7252906974107316,"h":0.013081395872222901,"c":1,"w":0.72279261271158857,"t":"trees. Millions of mangrove trees have now been planted which has resulted in the return of","x":0.073921968703052787},{"c":1,"t":"a healthy aquatic ecosystem. The mangroves also act as a defence against the increased","h":0.011627907316944963,"w":0.70841888427734379,"x":0.073921974598580006,"y":0.74127906959561118},{"w":0.72689936319986981,"x":0.071868593439241596,"t":"threat of flooding caused by climate change. What's more, the local economy is more stable","h":0.016050113126591548,"c":1,"y":0.75575221233178269},{"c":1,"y":0.77168141582217264,"t":"and thousands more Madagascans are now able to send their children to school.","w":0.64065709431966145,"h":0.01179941002949858,"x":0.073921966066648873},{"h":0.011799410029498469,"c":1,"y":0.79498525051068536,"x":0.07597536311457323,"t":"One other important point to consider . ..","w":0.32238192240397134},{"h":0.013081394746943475,"x":0.83778234048239864,"y":0.32994186070065612,"w":0.039014374415079711,"t":"Q35","c":1},{"w":0.039014371236165357,"t":"Q36","y":0.37645348850952243,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"x":0.8377823420256546},{"x":0.83778234041623367,"w":0.039014374415079711,"h":0.011627907316945074,"c":1,"y":0.49563953468132071,"t":"Q37"},{"h":0.013081394746943475,"c":1,"t":"Q38","y":0.55523255840200703,"w":0.039014374415079711,"x":0.83778234041053001},{"c":1,"w":0.039014374415079711,"t":"Q39","x":0.83778234041053001,"h":0.013081394746943587,"y":0.66133720956479769},{"x":0.83778234041694688,"c":1,"t":"Q40","y":0.73837209328332332,"w":0.039014374415079711,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"w":0.039014374415079711,"y":0.92151162816944876,"t":"119","x":0.868583161765766},{"c":1,"y":0.94166666658950615,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.51176470218237247,"w":0.45294118245442705,"h":0.04166666666666663}]}